{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":214500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"route","t":2802.0411550000003,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":9292.317955,"text":"Im Jahr 1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensand zur Liste der gefährdeten Weltkulturerbegebiete hinzugefügt."},{"kind":"text","t":9680.812361999999,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of endangered World Heritage sites due to the threat from desert sand. "},{"kind":"audio","t":9734.81476,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9736.847319999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9738.037591,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9739.230846999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":9740.882704,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9742.33521,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"route","t":10602.264502,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":21414.567718,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film Das Vermächtnis der Tempelritter gesehen haben, denken Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte gezeichnet wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":21885.056699,"text":"If you’ve watched the movie “The Templar Legacy,” you might think that a treasure map was drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence. "},{"kind":"audio","t":21940.974951,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21942.318744,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21944.098152,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21945.918461999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21947.794566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21949.486613,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21950.414109,"samples":22392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"route","t":23102.478332,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"text","t":29396.418031999998,"text":"Children are placed in foster families for a variety of reasons. "},{"kind":"audio","t":29439.69152,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":29441.214913,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29442.928923,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29443.841066,"samples":22296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":34632.378142,"text":"Kinder werden aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien untergebracht, und zwar aus verschiedenen Gründen, die von Vernachlässigung über Missbrauch bis hin zur Erpressung reichen."},{"kind":"text","t":34880.31883800001,"text":"That is, for various reasons, ranging from neglect to abuse to extortion. "},{"kind":"audio","t":34925.68090000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34926.614225000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34928.39153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34930.242076,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":34930.434836,"samples":8128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":34930.523530000006,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"route","t":37002.043978,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":45215.934573000006,"text":"Das Cochamo-Tal Chiles wichtigstes Kletterziel, bekannt als der Josemite National Park von Südamerika mit einer Vielzahl von großen Granitwänden und Klippen."},{"kind":"text","t":45694.375604,"text":"The Cochamo Valley is Chile’s most important climbing destination, known as South America’s version of Yosemite National Park, featuring numerous large granite walls and cliffs. "},{"kind":"audio","t":45748.691954,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45750.38619500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":45752.202639,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45753.946464,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45755.773404,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45757.831001000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45759.387574,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45761.323468,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45763.143057,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":45763.29112,"samples":9888,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":47401.80929500001,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":52146.331340000004,"text":"Aristoteles' Ansichten zu allen Wissenschaftsfragen einschließlich der Psychologie waren anerkannt."},{"kind":"text","t":52410.909731,"text":"Aristotle's views on all scientific matters, including psychology, were recognized. "},{"kind":"audio","t":52454.886898000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52456.440396000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52458.14537300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52459.868406,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52461.152749,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"route","t":53702.679216000004,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"text","t":59950.995621,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on country roads, stay cautious. "},{"kind":"audio","t":59993.014971000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59994.678746000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":59996.359346000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":59996.535531,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":62813.145506,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie achtsam. Steiles Gefälle, enge Fahrbahnen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen hier."},{"kind":"text","t":63076.467556,"text":"Steep slopes, narrow roads, and sharp turns predominate here. "},{"kind":"audio","t":63116.485774,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":63118.100725000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":63119.828916000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":63119.972993,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":64502.33806000001,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":75759.16953900001,"text":"Die Gegenwart eines echten, unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und LaFasto, 1989, Seite 109."},{"kind":"text","t":76180.754826,"text":"The presence of a real, invisible team, Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109. "},{"kind":"audio","t":76228.849422,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76230.39675100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":76232.24461200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76233.971111,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76235.76257800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76237.270468,"samples":30560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":610},{"kind":"route","t":76237.390719,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":77706.39505,"text":"ist auch ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"text","t":77899.08034300001,"text":"It is also a unique component of a virtual team. "},{"kind":"audio","t":77939.17793,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77940.834944,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77942.309364,"samples":32264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"route","t":83505.845793,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"text","t":89750.313524,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to a hospital. "},{"kind":"audio","t":89793.666291,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":89794.971877,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89796.743934,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":89796.851907,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":90743.974287,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht. Er verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"text","t":90861.444101,"text":"He passed away shortly after. "},{"kind":"audio","t":90900.270995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90901.285082,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":90901.447076,"samples":464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":92901.951055,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"text","t":99304.75157000001,"text":"Many German baked goods also contain almonds, hazelnuts, or other nuts. "},{"kind":"audio","t":99348.540213,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99350.149135,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99351.93391200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99353.798859,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":99353.902655,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":101123.870246,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren beinhalten außerdem Mandeln, Haselnüsse oder andere Nüsse. Beliebte Kuchen passen häufig besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"text","t":101347.85531300001,"text":"Popular cakes often pair especially well with a cup of strong coffee. "},{"kind":"audio","t":101391.522514,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":101393.102752,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101394.92927200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101396.274957,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"route","t":102801.89430700001,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":107992.503622,"text":"Wenn man eine romanische Sprache spricht, ist es natürlich leichter, Portugiesisch zu erlernen."},{"kind":"text","t":108244.095725,"text":"If you speak a Romance language, it’s naturally easier to learn Portuguese. "},{"kind":"audio","t":108289.236334,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108290.613477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108292.40237,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108294.198093,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":108294.299215,"samples":2128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":109600.754657,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":116365.19939200001,"text":"Die Klang- und Lichtshow bei den Pyramiden ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen für Kinder in der Gegend."},{"kind":"text","t":116730.923203,"text":"The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area. "},{"kind":"audio","t":116778.802003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116780.121259,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116781.871644,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":116783.74527500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":116785.533997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":116785.84482500001,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":117701.747521,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":127096.33423800001,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten und der Interaktionen, die zwischen beiden stattfinden."},{"kind":"text","t":127484.646311,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and the interactions that occur between them. "},{"kind":"audio","t":127536.4173,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":127538.082997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127539.92714300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127541.765531,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127543.597228,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":127545.510097,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127547.452371,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":127547.55134,"samples":4024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":129301.565296,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":138039.022248,"text":"Der Australier Mitchell Gurley wurde 11. im stehenden Super-G der Männer. Der tschechische Konkurrent Aldrich Jelinek wurde 16. im sitzenden Super-G der Männer."},{"kind":"text","t":138389.489174,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley became the 11th. Men's standing Super-G. The Czech competitor Aldrich Jelinek finished in 16th place. Men's sitting Super-G. "},{"kind":"audio","t":138435.057516,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138437.617029,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138438.35703299998,"samples":23264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"audio","t":138484.66474799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138486.204396,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138488.162804,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138490.118528,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138491.408019,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":540},{"kind":"audio","t":138522.340611,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":138522.681774,"samples":20632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":330},{"kind":"route","t":140101.372863,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":151558.786242,"text":"Das Haitianische Institut für Gerechtigkeit und Demokratie hat auf unabhängigen Studien verwiesen, die nahelegen, dass das nepalesische UN-Friedensbataillon die Krankheit unwissentlich nach Haiti eingeschleppt hat."},{"kind":"text","t":152005.721267,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that the Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion inadvertently brought the disease to Haiti. "},{"kind":"audio","t":152059.928494,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152061.19167499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":152062.92475399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152064.785565,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":152066.633476,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152068.450101,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152070.24310999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":152072.022008,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":152073.866414,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":152074.12922,"samples":11088,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":152074.219766,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"route","t":153901.46940099998,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":159349.310378,"text":"Bald nach dem Ausbruch von Kampfhandlungen initiierte Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland."},{"kind":"text","t":159617.501747,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain imposed a naval blockade on Germany. "},{"kind":"audio","t":159661.864365,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159663.298364,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":159664.955839,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159666.773624,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159668.016175,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"route","t":161001.722587,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"text","t":166282.97397199998,"text":"He also attacked anything that went into the water. "},{"kind":"audio","t":166322.721443,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166324.434091,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":166325.54882899998,"samples":26864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":167782.11695,"text":"Er griff auch alles an, was ins Wasser kam. Selbst ein großer Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex war ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"text","t":168017.91697199998,"text":"Not even a giant dinosaur like the T-Rex could match him. "},{"kind":"audio","t":168059.337581,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168061.072803,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168062.94405,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":168063.060956,"samples":5496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":168800.692216,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":179419.51606499997,"text":"Die Verwendung von Videoaufzeichnungen führte zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen für die Deutung von Mikroexpressionen, wenige Millisekunden dauernden Gesichtsbewegungen."},{"kind":"text","t":179810.814954,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important insights for interpreting microexpressions—face movements that last just a few milliseconds. "},{"kind":"audio","t":179860.472792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179862.014152,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179863.754632,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179865.589844,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179867.357665,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179869.065446,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179870.883553,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179871.357226,"samples":14824,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"route","t":181600.96198,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":189675.421405,"text":"Die Ankündigung erfolgte nach einem Telefongespräch von Trump mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":189981.273864,"text":"The announcement came after a phone call between Trump and Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan. "},{"kind":"audio","t":190025.882872,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190027.546076,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":190029.30294,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190030.994476,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190032.63417499998,"samples":32728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"route","t":191900.947092,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":200086.014501,"text":"Es gibt Familienstrände, die manchmal überlaufen sind, mit einer schönen Einkaufspromenade entlang der Küste, das Schwimmen ist hier sicher."},{"kind":"text","t":200475.977869,"text":"There are family beaches that can be crowded at times, with a nice promenade along the coast; swimming here is safe. "},{"kind":"audio","t":200520.753639,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200522.394348,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200524.052264,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200525.89601899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200526.860861,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"audio","t":200557.194692,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200557.53805899998,"samples":17632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"route","t":201901.828863,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"input","t":213174.079562,"text":"Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Nationen oder zu Frankreich gehörig und als luxuriöse Seebäder."},{"kind":"text","t":213481.42987599998,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or part of France and serve as luxurious seaside resorts. "},{"kind":"audio","t":213516.59558999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":213518.293186,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213520.010471,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213521.81270299997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213524.036661,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213526.088379,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"route","t":213526.23538099998,"type":"route","src":"de"},{"kind":"close","t":224603.885434,"code":1005}]}